  "prefLabel": "Lsa 103.04 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lsa 103.04 Organization. Biennially, the board shall elect or appoint a chairperson, vice-chairperson, and secretary at the first meeting of the board in a calendar year.\n\nSource. #8858, eff 3-28-07; renumbered by #13630 (formerly Lsa 103.05)",
